OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy, 12,
OL,4,Aand fled to Latvia jailed for more than
OL,5,Anine years
OL,6,
OL,7,FKeaton Slater, 12, was killed in a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run as he walked home from
OL,9,Fschool in June 2024
OL,11,FDriver Aleksanders Dolars fled to
OL,12,FLatvia afterwards and was only
OL,13,Fextradited back to UK in August this
OL,14,Fyear
OL,16,FThe 23-year-old Latvian admitted
OL,17,Fcausing death by dangerous driving, and
OL,18,Fhad been doing 70mph in a 30mph zone
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
