OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed schoolboy, 12,
OL,4,Aand fled to Latvia jailed for more than
OL,5,Anine years
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolars, who has been jailed for more
OL,8,Fthan nine years, did not want to attend
OL,9,Fhis sentencing hearing, but the judge
OL,10,Fdemanded he be brought to court
OL,12,FFollowing the sentencing, Keaton's
OL,13,Fparents shared a letter written by the
OL,14,F12-year-old to his "future self"
OL,16,FThe defendant had been known publicly
OL,17,Fas Dolars Aleksanders, but the court
OL,18,Fhas confirmed Latvian officials say it
OL,19,Fis Aleksanders Dolars
OL,21,FA special programme by BBC CWR charts
OL,22,FKeaton's family's fight for justice
